    1.06
   ],
   "crown": 1.8,
   "note": "VISION says r 0.11 at y 1.71, which crowns at 1.82 on a 1.80 rig; 0.10 at 1.70 lands exactly on bindHeight. ellipsoidScale flattens X and lengthens Z because a skull is ~4 cm narrower than it is deep (half-extents 0.08 wide / 0.106 deep)."
  },
